WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.200
Every agent run streams in as a trace.

00:02.300 --> 00:03.900
No code changes, one environment variable.

00:04.200 --> 00:06.000
Gates decide what needs a human.

00:06.100 --> 00:07.900
Evals, a code owner and a clean diff summary.

00:08.200 --> 00:10.000
Then the change ships to five percent.

00:10.100 --> 00:11.800
If anything moves, Tensile rolls it back.
